        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pleasant_Valley_(CDP)%2C_New_York",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town’s name reflects its gentle landscape: “Pleasant Valley” was chosen to highlight the area’s rolling hills and scenic beauty.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
